{{!
    @template theme_brandable/editor_generation

    A generation in progress (or failed) in the editor thread: the prompt, then the events of each attempt
    (run 0: generation, 1..n: repairs). Messages come from the generator and are shown as is (escaped).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * prompt - Prompt
    * running - Whether the generation is still running (and Brandable answers)
    * waiting, waitingmessage - Brandable unavailable while it runs: the request is kept, read again later
    * failed - Whether it failed
    * errormessage - Error shown as is
    * runs - Attempts: label, events (message, isrejected)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "prompt": "Make the navbar dark",
        "running": true,
        "waiting": false,
        "waitingmessage": "",
        "failed": false,
        "errormessage": "",
        "runs": [
            {"label": "Generation", "events": [{"message": "Planning the changes", "isrejected": false}]}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="tbe-entry tbe-generation" data-region="generation">
    <div class="tbe-bubble-user">{{prompt}}</div>
    <div class="tbe-bubble-reply{{#failed}} is-failed{{/failed}}">
        {{#runs}}
            <div class="tbe-run">
                <div class="tbe-run-label">{{label}}</div>
                <ul class="tbe-events">
                    {{#events}}
                        <li class="{{#isrejected}}is-rejected{{/isrejected}}">{{message}}</li>
                    {{/events}}
                </ul>
            </div>
        {{/runs}}
        {{#running}}
            <div class="tbe-working"><span class="tbe-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{#str}} generating, theme_brandable {{/str}}</div>
        {{/running}}
        {{#waiting}}
            <div class="tbe-working" role="status"><span class="tbe-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{waitingmessage}}</div>
        {{/waiting}}
        {{#failed}}
            <div class="tbe-error" role="alert">{{errormessage}}</div>
        {{/failed}}
    </div>
</div>
